Rule 2 (scatter_indices must have an integer data type, represented by type codes 1 to 5)
{v_2 : tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype_(v_2) ∧ dtype_(v_2) ≤ 5
>>
Rule 3 (mode must be one of the allowed JAX gather/scatter modes)
{v_7 : str} |= v_7 = "clip" ∨ v_7 = "drop" ∨ v_7 = "fill" ∨ v_7 = "promise_in_bounds"
>>
Rule 4 (operand dimension must be at least 1)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
