Rule 9 (the last dimension of scatter_indices cannot exceed the rank of the operand)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) ≤ ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 10 (if mode is promise_in_bounds, scatter indices must be non-negative)
{v_2 : tensor, v_7 : str} |= if v_7 = "promise_in_bounds" then min(v_2) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 11 (updates tensor dimensions must all be positive)
{v_3 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_3) - 1] : shape(v_3, i) > 0
>>
Rule 13 (scatter_indices must be at least 1-dimensional)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 14 (the last dimension of scatter_indices represents the index depth and cannot exceed the operand rank)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= shape(v_2, ndim(v_2) - 1) ≤ ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 17 (dimension_numbers tuple must have a length of at least 1 and contain non-negative dimension indices)
{v_4 : tuple(int)} |= v_4.len ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_4.len - 1] : v_4[i] ≥ 0
>>
Rule 19 (scatter_indices rank must be within a common practical range of 1 to 4)
{v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) ≥ 1 ∧ ndim(v_2) ≤ 4
>>
Rule 20 (scatter mode cannot be a data format string like NHWC or NCHW)
{v_7 : str} |= v_7 ≠ "NHWC" ∧ v_7 ≠ "NCHW"
>>
Rule 21 (updates tensor must be at least 1-dimensional and have a positive first dimension size)
{v_3 : tensor} |= ndim(v_3) ≥ 1 ∧ shape(v_3, 0) > 0
